[I] Generate colorschemes from images

[T] Wallust is a fast and reliable way to generate beautiful, consistent and
[T] customizable color schemes from your favorite images. It is a rewrite of
[T] Pywal with multiple new features, such as language bindings, template
[T] engines, dynamic updates and much more. It finds the color palette of an
[T] image and uses it to generate color schemes, themes and styles for other
[T] applications through templates.

[U] https://codeberg.org/explosion-mental/wallust

